                                                "sense_id": "f4cb2bcd-3c59-37ea-bb79-5e09affb6ff5",
                                                "text": "These trenches, you know, are much deeper than one's height; you don't see anything. It's like walking along a mud-walled passage. Every now and then some one stumbles into a soakaway for rainwater."
